menu "Niro Device"
    config NIRO_LCD_INVERT
        bool "Invert the display's colours"
        default y
        help
            Many 240x240 ST7789 panels show inverted colours unless told to invert. If the screen looks like a
            negative, turn this off. Not known for this board until it is seen on the screen.
    config NIRO_LCD_MIRROR_X
        bool "Mirror the display horizontally"
        default n
    config NIRO_LCD_MIRROR_Y
        bool "Mirror the display vertically"
        default n
    config NIRO_LCD_SWAP_XY
        bool "Swap the display's axes"
        default n
    config NIRO_LCD_GAP_X
        int "Display column offset"
        default 0
    config NIRO_LCD_GAP_Y
        int "Display row offset"
        default 0
    config NIRO_BATTERY_DIVIDER_X10
        int "Battery divider ratio, times ten (20 is a divider of 2)"
        default 20
        help
            The battery is read through a resistor divider whose ratio is not known for this board. Measure the
            battery with a meter, compare it with the voltage the device logs ("battery ... mV"), and set this to
            (meter / logged) times ten times the value now.
    config NIRO_CHARGING_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "The charger pulls its status pin low while charging"
        default y
        help
            Most charger chips (a TP4056's CHRG) pull the pin low while charging. Not read from this board yet:
            if the device says it charges when it does not, turn this off.
    config NIRO_MIC_SHIFT
        int "Microphone gain: right shift of the 32 bit sample (smaller is louder)"
        default 14
        range 8 20
        help
            The microphone is not known for this board; most I2S MEMS microphones fit a shift of 14 to 16. If speech is
            too quiet to be understood, lower it; if it clips, raise it.
    config NIRO_MIC_RIGHT
        bool "The microphone answers on the right channel"
        default n
        help
            Depends on how the microphone's L/R pin is tied. If nothing is heard at all, try this.
endmenu
